                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c380bf0d-c2c5-37f4-b119-6ca62b67a525",
                        "entry_id": "d9411347-e45f-376d-82bc-9f87b8f64c57",
                        "glosses": [
                            "normie, normal person"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Internet",
                            "derogatory",
                            "masculine",
                            "person",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f006d097-7dee-4edd-8e21-1d1d467bc8b2",
                                "sense_id": "c380bf0d-c2c5-37f4-b119-6ca62b67a525",
                                "text": "Nie powinno nas to zadowalać, że “normicy” mówią, iż „przecież ci antyfaszyści to najgorsi faszyści”.",
                                "translation": "It shouldn't make us happy that the \"normies\" say that, \"after all, those antifascists are the worst fascists\".",
                                "english": "It shouldn't make us happy that the \"normies\" say that, \"after all, those antifascists are the worst fascists\"."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "376bc853-08e7-4e76-a6b3-844f9e9a14f6",
                                "sense_id": "c380bf0d-c2c5-37f4-b119-6ca62b67a525",
                                "text": "- W kategorii „słowo ciekawie zbudowane” wyróżniamy wyraz zwyklak. Rzeczownik o oczywistej strukturze, podobny do nieco starszego normika pojawił się w sieci dopiero przed rokiem. Nie każdy musi być prestiżowy. Zwyklaki i normiki też są na świecie. Doceniamy także słowotwórczą inwencję złożenia mamadżer „młoda mama i menadżer w jednym” - zaznacza Łaziński.",
                                "translation": "\"In the category 'curiously built word', we distinguish the expression zwyklak [also meaning 'normal person']. This noun with a clear structure, similar to the slightly older 'normie', appeared on the Internet only a year ago. Not everyone needs to be prestigious. There are also squares and normies in the world. We also value the word-coining invention of putting together 'mamager' [Polish: mamadżer], a young mother and a manager in the same person,\" Łaziński indicates.",
                                "english": "\"In the category 'curiously built word', we distinguish the expression zwyklak [also meaning 'normal person']. This noun with a clear structure, similar to the slightly older 'normie', appeared on the Internet only a year ago. Not everyone needs to be prestigious. There are also squares and normies in the world. We also value the word-coining invention of putting together 'mamager' [Polish: mamadżer], a young mother and a manager in the same person,\" Łaziński indicates."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "230ce131-c551-4b04-8b2f-0477f7f6dab1",
                                "sense_id": "c380bf0d-c2c5-37f4-b119-6ca62b67a525",
                                "text": "Są oczywiście także normie (po polsku \"normiki\"), czyli ci, którzy nie prowadzą nabyt ożywionego życia seksualnego, ale nie są też incelami.",
                                "translation": "Of course, there are also the normie [originally English] (in Polish \"normies\"), meaning those who don't lead a very lively sex life but aren't incels either.",
                                "english": "Of course, there are also the normie [originally English] (in Polish \"normies\"), meaning those who don't lead a very lively sex life but aren't incels either."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb58e7ca-667c-446d-919a-d79726fdb657",
                                "sense_id": "c380bf0d-c2c5-37f4-b119-6ca62b67a525",
                                "text": "Część nagranych przez autora kanału tekstów mogła pochodzić z serwisu karachan.org i w ten sposób zostać udostępniona tzw. normikom (czyli niewtajemniczonym), co stoi w sprzeczności z zasadą, że \"co powstało na karachanie, zostaje na karachanie\".",
                                "translation": "Part of the texts recorded by the [YouTube] channel's author could have come from the website karachan.org and thus have been made accessible to the so-called normies (meaning the uninitiated), which stands in contradiction to the rule that 'what happened on karachan stays on karachan'.",
                                "english": "Part of the texts recorded by the [YouTube] channel's author could have come from the website karachan.org and thus have been made accessible to the so-called normies (meaning the uninitiated), which stands in contradiction to the rule that 'what happened on karachan stays on karachan'."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee843881-42c0-40d6-b930-51b13feec12c",
                                "sense_id": "c380bf0d-c2c5-37f4-b119-6ca62b67a525",
                                "text": "‒ Mogę zgadywać nie lepiej niż byle jaki normik ‒ powiedział. [...]\n‒ Kim jest normik? ‒ wyszeptała, bojąc się, że inaczej będzie krzyczeć. [...]\n‒ Normik to jest ktoś, kto wyznacza normę ‒ powiedział. ‒ Czyli większość ludzi żyjących od pierwszego do pierwszego.",
                                "translation": "\"I can't guess any better than any normie,\" he said. …\n\"Who is a normie?\" she whispered, fearing that otherwise she would yell. …\n\"A normie is someone who follows the norm,\" he said. \"So most of the people who live from one thing to the next. …\"",
                                "english": "\"I can't guess any better than any normie,\" he said. …\n\"Who is a normie?\" she whispered, fearing that otherwise she would yell. …\n\"A normie is someone who follows the norm,\" he said. \"So most of the people who live from one thing to the next. …\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
